# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M6 Relax (the toolbar's Relax, Task 10's relax button): H2 at R = 1.6 Bohr relaxes with FIRE to
# the minimum of the sigma = h = 0.25 surface (about 1.79 Bohr; the sigma -> 0 LSDA minimum is
# 1.45, README "Physics, honestly"), the readout says it converged, and the run is left paused.
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
# pinned at the merge of main (2026-10-14): written for the presets' own 49^3 x 0.25 grid (Balanced)
# without container walls, before the app defaulted to Accurate (81^3) with walls on; H2 is the
# R = 1.6 Bohr scene it was written for (h2_r16.scene; the h2 preset is 1.45 Bohr now)
action ionic none
action quality balanced
action walls off 4.5
scene h2_r16.scene
wait idle
action relax
wait idle
expect relaxed true
expect dist 0 1 1.75 1.83
expect paused true
expect no-error
